{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/mouth.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a sootball creature born from the festering abyss, forged as a living tool by the <strong>Abyssal Maw</strong> at the map's center. This realm is its digestive playground\u2014monsters spawn from rotting flesh carpets, and your sole purpose is to hunt, haul, and feed, using meat to quell its endless hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hunt &amp; Haul Cycle</strong>: Slay mutated horrors spawned near the Abyssal Maw, drag corpses yourself, or command split-off <strong>Mini SootBall</strong> to assist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/feed.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bone Currency</strong>: The Maw vomits &quot;Corrupted Bone Shards&quot; after devouring flesh. Spend them at the edge-of-map <strong>Chest Monster: Rotfang</strong> to choose 1 of 3 random upgrades (e.g., teleport dodge, poison mist, temporary shields).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/roll.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chaos Challenges</strong>: The Maw may trigger mutations\u2014darkness leaving only its glow, or lava fissures splitting the ground. Survive these trials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/cha.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Risk vs. Reward</strong>: Deploy more Mini SootBall to boost hauling speed, or keep them close to slaughter faster. Choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/carry.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Endgame</strong>:</i><br>Trade Bone Shards for power, build your sootball army, and survive the Maw\u2019s growing madness. But remember\u2014the more you feed it, the hungrier the abyss grows\u2026 and more terrifying creatures awaken.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732120?t=1747186678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3732120?t=1747186678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/5e01d3ac2e8c04ff09b6bae2343446dc6a1abe8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747186678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/5e01d3ac2e8c04ff09b6bae2343446dc6a1abe8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747186678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732120/extras/mouth.gif?t=1747186678\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a sootball creature born from the festering abyss, forged as a living tool by the <strong>Abyssal Maw</strong> at the map's center. This realm is its digestive playground\u2014monsters spawn from rotting flesh carpets, and your sole purpose is to hunt, haul, and feed, using meat to quell its endless hunger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap